{"data":[{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-25T01:00:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114160017578357030"],"id":"2114160017578357030","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":40,"impression_count":68704,"like_count":395,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":51,"retweet_count":14},"text":"苹果宣布向西藏地震灾区捐款，网友反讽：“脊梁骨没听说捐钱，警惕海外势力”\n\n10月23日，苹果CEO约翰·特努斯宣布，将捐款支持西藏那曲地震灾区的救援组织。库克随后转发，表示牵挂受灾民众，并感谢一线搜救人员。\n\n网友调侃：\n“脊梁骨没听说捐钱，警惕海外势力”\n“恶意慈善这个词好不好” https://t.co/PXdd9phNsy https://t.co/a210WttSMI","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2114160017578357030"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-25T00:58:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114159598089187685"],"id":"2114159598089187685","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4517,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"｜黄晓明、杨颖一张全家福，网友高喊：复合！｜\n\n照片里，杨颖靠着黄晓明，儿子也在身边，熟悉的一家三口同框，瞬间把人拉回他们当年恩爱的日子。\n\n想当初，一场世纪婚礼，半个娱乐圈到场，排场有多大，后来离婚时就有多让人唏嘘。","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2114159598089187685"},{"author_id":"1499656309565657089","created_at":"2026-10-25T00:50:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114157583338787130"],"id":"2114157583338787130","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":25967,"like_count":82,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":49,"retweet_count":7},"text":"昨晚 11 点的时候，ETH 最低跌到 $2,282，这个超大 ETH 多仓巨鲸/机构就差 $30 刀被清算。\n所以他在凌晨赶紧补充了 921 万 USDC 保证金，把 ETH 多仓清算价从 $2,256 降到现在的 $2,181，暂时脱离 ICU。\n\n现在他持有价值高达 $3.965 亿的 BTC 及 ETH 多单：\n◎115,473 枚 ETH ($2.721 https://t.co/bxDUklj7Ot https://t.co/vycv5HNwhz","url":"https://x.com/EmberCN/status/2114157583338787130"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-25T00:44:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114156147389432133"],"id":"2114156147389432133","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":10988,"like_count":135,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":133,"retweet_count":5},"text":"“胸怀大痣”算什么，\n猫神本尊只晒胸怀大志👍🌹\n\n美貌是天赋，书架才是底气\n胸中泛滥三千卷，足下纵横